{"id":"fest","name":{"en":"Fest","ja":"フェスト"},"desc":{"en":"A mineral found all around Arland. It's soft and crumbles when squeezed. Alchemists pulverize it before using it for anything.","ja":"アーランド全域でよく見られる鉱物。非常に 柔らかく、手で軽く握っただけでもボロボロ 崩れる。錬金術の材料としては、極限まで細 かく砕いてから使うのが一般的。"},"level":1,"locations":[{"id":"arland-wastelands","name":{"en":"Arland Wastelands","ja":"アーランド東の荒野"}},{"id":"primordial-island","name":{"en":"Primordial Island","ja":"原初の島"}},{"id":"scorched-wasteland","name":{"en":"Scorched Wasteland","ja":"灼熱の荒野"},"parent":"arland-wastelands"}],"categories":[{"id":"ore","name":{"en":"(Ore)","ja":"（鉱石類）"},"icon":"totori-category-ore"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":16}